&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsided gym membership / plans through Wellhub  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electric Car scheme  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work scheme  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch on office days &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Parental Leave &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days annual PTO plus b/h&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal development opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
