&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW169204765 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169204765 BCX8&quot;&gt;The employee will have the legal right to work in the United Kingdom and will be able to produce right to work documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Employee must undergo a minimum of BPSS check.&amp;nbsp;Employee must be willing to sign the Official Secrets Act.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
